  Outside this computer
  • Creates the tunnel if missing: cloudflared tunnel create bonsai-wsl
  • Routes your hostname: cloudflared tunnel route dns bonsai-wsl
    hooks.example.com. Existing DNS records are never overwritten.
  • Starts a Cloudflare tunnel that forwards only Bonsai's change receiver
    (127.0.0.1:7002) to the internet.

  Bonsai saves your settings to ~/.config/bonsai/web.json and starts in the
  background.
  Your browser opens when it is ready.
  Then Bonsai waits for GitHub to confirm each webhook (about a minute at
  most).
